Jesus rose up and went with him. And so did his disciples.
Suddenly, a woman came from behind Jesus. She was sick, causing her to bleed. This disease had lasted for 12 years. She touched the edge of his clothes.
"I only need to touch his clothes. Then I will be saved," she thought.
Jesus perceived this, and seeing the woman, he said to her, "Woman, you have great faith, do not despair of hope." And he added, "Your faith has made you well." And God healed her at that very moment.
When Jesus entered the ruler's house, he saw the flute players there. And he saw the noisy crowd.
