Heal the sick. Raise the dead. Cleanse the bodies. Drive out demons. You received freely, so freely you have been given.
Neither gold, nor silver, nor copper shall you carry in your purses.
Do not take a bag for the trip. Do not take extra clothes, sandals, or walking sticks. The operative must be given what he needs.
When you enter a town or village, look for someone willing to host you. Stay at that person's home until you leave.
