If that house welcomes you, give it your blessing of peace. If it does not, do not give it the blessing.
Some people may not welcome you or listen to your words. So if they do not, shake the dust of your feet when you leave that house or city.
What I am about to tell you is the truth. On the day of reckoning, it will be easier for the people of Sodom and Gomorrah than for that city.
